{"id":"sinal","lemma":"sinal","pos":"noun","rank":461,"glosses":["sign; mark; trace (a visible or otherwise perceivable indication of something)","mark (a blemish, stain, scratch, scar or similar on a surface, especially on the skin)","signal (a visual or audible indication made to give notice of some occurrence, command or danger)"],"ipa":"/siˈnaw/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/47/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-sinal.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-sinal.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sinais"},"formAudio":{"sinais":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-sinais.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Não há sinal de vida.","en":"There's no sign of life.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"state of being alive"}]},{"text":"Isso é um mau sinal?","en":"Is this a bad sign?","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad"},null]},{"text":"Não havia sinais de vida na ilha.","en":"There were no signs of life on the island.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"state of being alive"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"island"}]},{"text":"Isto não é bom sinal.","en":"This is not a good sign.","words":[{"g":"this"},null,null,{"g":"desirable"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"isn't it"]]},{"text":"Procure sinais de decomposição.","en":"Look for signs of decomposition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1268420","words":[{"g":"to search","l":"procurar"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"decomposition, decay"}]}]}